Wyoming livestock board-memorandums of
HB0092
understanding.
Sponsored By: Joint Agriculture, State and Public Lands & Water
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to the Wyoming livestock board; requiring the board to initiate
memorandums of understanding regarding the identification of livestock
delivered to other states; requiring reports; and providing for an effective
date.
